Modifications in this repository
--------------------------------
In accordance with section 4(b) of the Apache License 2.0, every modified file
carries a prominent notice and the changes are listed here.

1. README.md
   Translated into Russian. The original English text is preserved verbatim as
   README.en.md and is otherwise untouched. A section describing the origin,
   the license and the trademark position of the project was added.

2. README.en.md
   New file. Verbatim copy of the upstream README.md at commit fd12aee.

3. NOTICE
   New file (this one). Attribution and a list of changes.

4. Dockerfile
   The build-time download
     ADD https://raw.githubusercontent.com/datarhei/restreamer/2.x/CHANGELOG.md ...
   was replaced with
     COPY ./CHANGELOG.md ...
   so that building the image does not depend on network access to the upstream
   repository. The resulting image contents are identical.

5. .github/workflows/*
   Adapted so that they run on GitHub-hosted runners instead of the upstream
   self-hosted runners, publish images to GitHub Container Registry instead of
   Docker Hub, and can be triggered without access to upstream secrets.
   Details: scripts and build arguments are unchanged; only the runner labels,
   the registry, the authentication steps and the trigger configuration differ.

6. .github/workflows/ci.yml
   New file. Builds the image and runs a smoke test on push and pull request.

